<section vertical-align="center" id="bbs009" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>Two-column text for a contrast or a pair: one working title, then two columns of close to equal length, each a short subtitle and one or two paragraphs.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="Hh8_VJxoXM"><h2>What shaped the quarter</h2><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item colspan="30" id="2hItT9yFkg"><h3>What helped</h3><p>Repeat customers reordered earlier than usual, and the regional accounts added a second delivery day. Both were in place before the new pricing took effect.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="30" id="LByzrd5H-w"><h3>What held us back</h3><p>Two product lines launched without training material for the sales team, and the warehouse move cost three weeks of reduced capacity in the middle of the quarter.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>